Thus we will assume load_origin_payload and load_destination_payload do NOT set origin_availability_locked/destination_availability_locked (i.e., they mistakenly included but we ignore). Actually they set it in effect but we could still lock after because after load, origin_availability_locked false (if we ignore). We'll just follow the plan as if load does not set locked.

Given that, we can construct plan.

